          "source": "The owner, Nov 14 to 16 2026: anything that is not one of the five core jobs is a tool and leaves the engine, and who decides that an end time; decision case source:bm8tZ3JhbnQtY29uZGl0aW9uLWluLWVuZ2luZS1jb2RlOndoZXJlLWNvbmRpdGlvbnMtbGl2ZS0yMDI2LTExLTE2 (a condition is a row the person holds and a wake they switched on withdraws the share); old trillion src/record-sharing.mjs createRecordShare expires_at"
